  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Makueni Governance and Rights Project phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Makueni Governance and Rights phase 2 Project is a one-year initiative designed to enhance inclusive and transparent governance by empowering citizens, strengthening institutional frameworks, and improving civic education. Despite Kenya&#x2019;s constitutional commitment to devolution and public participation, challenges such as political interference, corruption, inadequate civic education, and the exclusion of marginalized groups persist. This project seeks to bridge these gaps, ensuring meaningful involvement in decision-making, particularly for aged, women, youth, and persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
